<title>UK: TVA ups Nov 2025 Eurobond increase to $750 million.</title>
<headline>TVA ups Nov 2025 Eurobond increase to $750 million.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tennessee Valley Authority has raised to $750 million from $500 million the size of its fungible November 2025 Eurobond, lead manager Lehman Brothers International said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal, which was launched on Wednesday, has also been priced at a spread of 27 basis points over U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>It is fungible with a $600 million deal originally launched in October 1995.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT	  $750 MLN  COUPON     6.75 PCT  MATURITY    01.NOV.25</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.074   PAY DATE   *07.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   REOFFER    100.074   SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *PLUS 96 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
